{0}ExclusiveOrExclusiveWith__Exec_NodeExecute that burn, if you do everything correctly you should see the encounter node even after removing the maneuver node. If not I recommend you set up another correction maneuver as soon as possible, the closer you are to the Celestial Body you want to reach the more dV it takes to correct the course.

