If you see this message, something is broken about how this program got compiled.If you turn on 'Stability Control' then the autopilot will use the reaction wheel's torque to keep the rover aligned with the surface.
This means that if you make a jump the autopilot will try to align the rover in the best possible way to land as straight and flat as possible given the available time and torque.
Be aware that this doesn't make your rover indestructible, only relatively unlikely to land in a bad way.

'Stability Control' will also limit the brake to reduce the chances of flipping over from too much braking power.
See 'Settings' -> 'Traction and Braking'. This setting is also saved per vessel.If-MatchIf-Modified-SinceIf-None-MatchIf-RangeIf-Unmodified-SinceIgbo (Nigeria)Ignore Agency Mindset on ContractsIgnore Max TemperatureIgnore RaycastIgnore landing site with null valueIgnoreCommentsIgnoreProcessingInstructionsIgnoreProjectorIgnoreWhitespaceIgnoring mass of launch clampIkeIke FlybyIllegal \ at end of pattern.Illegal characters in path.Illegal conditional (?(...)) expression.Illegal enum value: {0}.Illegal filenameIllegal rep dist codeIllegal rep length codeIllegal {x,y} with x > y.ImageImage file dimensions below minimum size (1280x720), skipping the fileImage type of Image unable to be loaded, skipping the fileImmediateLevelUpImpactImpact AltitudeImpact BiomeImpact LatitudeImpact LongitudeImpact MarkerImpact Switch! Impact TimeImpact Zero! Impact calc! iterations Impact iteration Impact pre ImportImport 3D Object / MeshImportantImproperly encoded saved file contains '&' without '#'Improperly encoded saved file contains '&' without closing ';'Improperly encoded saved file contains non-digits between the '&#' and the ';'Improperly protected machine's key pairs in '{0}'.Improperly protected user's key pairs in '{0}'.InIn 1.1.0, the LT1 legs were re-exported with a different pivot orientation and originIn 1.1.0, the LT2 legs were re-exported with a different pivot orientation and originIn Geometry In Sandbox Mode, there is no Science to be done.In Situ Resource Extraction ContractsIn Space HighIn Space LowInactiveInc: InclinationInclinationAccuracyIncompatible Delegate Types. First is {0} second is {1}.Incompatible Mods DetectedIncomplete DTD content.Incomplete \p{X} character escape.Incomplete entity contents.Inconsistent XML sequence was detected. If there are XmlElement/XmlArray/XmlAnyElement attributes with explicit Order, then every other member must have an explicit order too.Inconsistent metadata in the ZIP64 Central Directory.Inconsistent state during activation; the