DCannot use {0} where {1} is neededV'{0}' command found {1}. It only works {2}.‚@
All defaultable parameters must come at the
end of the list of all parameters for a
program or a function.
For example, this is legal:
   declare x, y is 0.
but this is not:
   declare x is 0, y.
because when x had a default then all other
parameters that came after it had to have one.
