of any expression.  This ensures no such values can ever get
passed in to KSP's stock API, which doesn't protect itself against their effects.N␀␀␀$Audible exceptionsdWhen kOS throws an error, you hear a sound effect.N␀␀␀$Verbose exceptions€æWhen kOS has an error, some error messages have alternative longer
paragraph-length descriptions that this enables.N␀␀␀4Allow clobbering built-insƒ4True if scripts' variable and function names are allowed to hide or clobber kOS's
